/ 許可メールアドレス一覧ページ
.container.mx-auto.px-4.py-8
  .flex.justify-between.items-center.mb-6
    h1.text-2xl.font-bold.text-gray-800.dark:text-gray-100 許可メールアドレス管理
    = link_to "新規追加", new_admin_allowed_email_path, class: "px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 dark:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded hover:bg-blue-700 dark:hover:bg-blue-600 transition"

  / 統計情報
  .mb-6.p-4.bg-gray-100.dark:bg-gray-800.rounded
    p.text-sm.text-gray-700.dark:text-gray-300
      | 登録数:
      strong.text-lg = @allowed_emails.total_count
      |  件

  / 一覧テーブル
  - if @allowed_emails.any?
    .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-900.rounded-lg.shadow.overflow-hidden
      .overflow-x-auto
        table.min-w-full.divide-y.divide-gray-200.dark:divide-gray-700
          thead.bg-gray-50.dark:bg-gray-800
            tr
              th.px-6.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400.uppercase.tracking-wider メールアドレス
              th.px-6.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400.uppercase.tracking-wider メモ
              th.px-6.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400.uppercase.tracking-wider 連絡
              th.px-6.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400.uppercase.tracking-wider 登録日時
              th.px-6.py-3.text-left.text-xs.font-medium.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400.uppercase.tracking-wider 操作

          tbody.bg-white.dark:bg-gray-900.divide-y.divide-gray-200.dark:divide-gray-700
            - @allowed_emails.each do |allowed_email|
              tr id="allowed_email_#{allowed_email.id}"
                td.px-6.py-4.whitespace-nowrap
                  .text-sm.font-medium.text-gray-900.dark:text-gray-100 = allowed_email.email
                td.px-6.py-4
                  .text-sm.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400 = allowed_email.note
                td.px-6.py-4.whitespace-nowrap
                  div id="notified_status_#{allowed_email.id}"
                    = render partial: "notified_button", locals: { allowed_email: allowed_email }
                td.px-6.py-4.whitespace-nowrap
                  .text-sm.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400 = l(allowed_email.created_at, format: :short)
                td.px-6.py-4.whitespace-nowrap.text-right.text-sm.font-medium
                  = link_to "削除", admin_allowed_email_path(allowed_email), data: { turbo_method: :delete, turbo_confirm: "本当に削除しますか？" }, class: "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400 hover:text-red-900 dark:hover:text-red-300"

    / ページネーション
    .mt-4
      = paginate @allowed_emails

  - else
    .bg-white.dark:bg-gray-900.rounded-lg.shadow.p-8.text-center
      p.text-gray-500.dark:text-gray-400 許可メールアドレスが登録されていません

  / 戻るリンク
  .mt-6
    = link_to "← 管理者ダッシュボードに戻る", admin_root_path, class: "text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline"
